cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite its archived version and the associated preprint when applicable."
title: "Kinetic model, assay design and parameter identifiability for fluorogenic haloalkane dehalogenase assays"
abstract: >-
  Computational kinetic model and simulation-based identifiability analysis
  for fluorogenic haloalkane dehalogenase assays. Reproduces the numerical
  analyses accompanying the preprint by Mion et al. (2026), based on
  published aggregate parameters rather than raw experimental data.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Trujillo"
    given-names: "Leonardo"
    affiliation: "INSA Lyon, Université Lyon 1, CNRS UMR5240, Villeurbanne, France"
    orcid" "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9995-4135"
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - enzyme kinetics
  - haloalkane dehalogenase
  - fluorogenic substrate
  - substrate inhibition
  - practical identifiability
  - quasi-steady-state approximation
